        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Blessed by the sun and sea, One nation enjoys complete harmony - Asteria. Behind the facade of peace, exploitation of the people was rampant, and from their pain, the demons were born.\n\nSeeking to unmask the evil and create a revolution, one group of new Demon Gazers stood tall... they were known as the Revolutionist Party.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Bendecida por el sol y el mar, una nación disfruta de una armonía completa: Asteria. Tras la fachada de paz, la explotación del pueblo era generalizada, y de su dolor nacieron los demonios.\n\nCon el objetivo de desenmascarar el mal y crear una revolución, un grupo de nuevos Demon Gazers se alzó... Eran conocidos como el Partido Revolucionario.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
